{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513380/extras/cc14e686ce039c6a3ba06373ae1ea31b.avif?t=1762748576\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513380/extras_big/cc14e686ce039c6a3ba06373ae1ea31b.avif?t=1762748576 width=1560 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare for chaos in <strong>MI10</strong>, a fast-paced, top-down roguelike shooter where <strong>every mission could be over in an instant</strong>. You are\u00a0<strong>MI10</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<i>affectionately known as \u201cMilo\u201d -\u00a0</i>the latest cleanup bot manufactured by Mira Industries. You\u2019ve been deployed to a series of derelict laboratories on distant planets, now overrun with horrific mutations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your mission: <strong>Eliminate every last creature and reclaim the labs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is a brutal test of skill. Adapt, dodge, and acquire upgrades as you battle enemies in <strong>fast-paced combat</strong>. Every mistake is costly, every success is earned.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513380/extras/579f5053cee3031a2f3316a094084570.avif?t=1762748576\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punishing Action</strong>: Reflex-driven combat where every second counts. Master dodging, aiming, and timing to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Chaos</strong>: No two runs are the same\u2014survive ever-changing labs filled with twisted experiments, hazards, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Darkly Cute Aesthetic</strong>: Explore a <strong>low-poly sci-fi world</strong> that\u2019s equal parts charming and unsettling \u2014 bright colors hiding brutal tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legacy of Failure</strong>: You\u2019re MI10, the latest in a line of cleanup bots that failed before you. Learn from their demise\u2026 or join their scrap heap. Will you break the cycle?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Mayhem:</strong> Unlock upgrades, experiment with builds, and push your limits across <strong>fast, high-intensity missions</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513380/extras/8eae23a111c40571d6b69645268d86c0.avif?t=1762748576\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The creatures are evolving. The labs are unstable. <strong>You are alone.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you be the last one standing or just another casualty of Mira Industries\u2019 experiments?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Moltonites Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513380/d1f015ce3a58a5e6eee2ce8922cbd96304efb167.jpg"},{"name":"Laser Evader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513380/983b7673210ad74e3200cb679efa9f3a967099bc.jpg"},{"name":"No More Nightmares","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513380/533357030c36237b070563cf6416c33411ae41d4.jpg"},{"name":"Frozen Flight No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513380/dd39593d26cbc9