rming and unsettling \u2014 bright colors hiding brutal tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legacy of Failure</strong>: You\u2019re MI10, the latest in a line of cleanup bots that failed before you. Learn from their demise\u2026 or join their scrap heap. Will you break the cycle?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Mayhem:</strong> Unlock upgrades, experiment with builds, and push your limits across <strong>fast, high-intensity missions</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513380/extras/8eae23a111c40571d6b69645268d86c0.avif?t=1762748576\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The creatures are evolving. The labs are unstable. <strong>You are alone.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you be the last one standing or just another casualty of Mira Industries\u2019 experiments?</strong></p>","developers":["mrmilo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513380/b902471c348f63bc33ee106d44329ab5add765c3/header.jpg?t=1762748576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3513380/75268169/8efb59ab10edb95abe2238ee8eceebb0526bbc25/1755484397/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755721486","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3513380/75268169/8efb59ab10edb95abe2238ee8eceebb0526bbc25/1755484397/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755721486","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3513380/75268169/8efb59ab10edb95abe2238ee8eceebb0526bbc25/1755484397/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755721486","id":257184588,"name"